<translate>
==== TwoWay ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If the parameter is true, then the item can play and transmit sound. If false - only play.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
TwoWay = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

